    participant PermissionService as Perm_Service
    participant Tool as Tool

    LLM_Agent->>LLM_Agent: Parse Output
    note over LLM_Agent: LLM output format: [tool_call: ...]

    LLM_Agent->>User: Tell User Action
    note over LLM_Agent,User: "Always tell the user what you are going to do before making a tool call"

