| Safeguard/Limitation | Description | Applicable Tools/Actions |
|---|---|---|
| Absolute Path Requirement for File Operations | All file system operations (read, write, delete) must specify an absolute path, preventing relative path ambiguities and unintended access outside the intended scope. | All file system tools (e.g., `view`, `edit`, `write`) |
